<title>AUSTRIA: BUBA'S ISSING SAYS CANNOT COMMENT ON DUBLIN ACCORD.</title>
<headline>BUBA'S ISSING SAYS CANNOT COMMENT ON DUBLIN ACCORD.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Otmar Issing said on Friday he was not able to comment on a broad agreement struck in Dublin for sound budget policies under a single European currency.</p>
<p>&quot;I cannot comment on it because I haven't seen it,&quot; Issing told reporters.</p>
</text>
